277
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:27,000
All right! I can't wait to see the look on his face when he sees it!

278
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:39,000
You two are so lucky! We just recently received a huge shipment of different spell cards!

279
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:42,000
