290
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:28,000
We'll take you to the exam site. Just leave it to us!

291
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:34,000
Let's hurry. I need to ace it. And then hurry back to Gon right away.

292
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:38,000
Sure! But the exam won't officially start for a few days!

293
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Oh yeah, that's right.

294
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:44,000
In the meantime, why don't you tell us all about your adventures with Gon?

295
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:49,000
Okay. Well, there was that one time that he came to my house.

296
00:19:49,000 --> 00:20:07,000
You're making steady progress, Gon. You're right on track to have your ultimate technique ready.

297
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,000
It helps that this is such a safe place to practice.

298
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:15,000
With this view, we can spot anyone before they get close enough to use an attack spell.

299
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:22,000
People are watching for Masadora. I feel it like I felt people watching us at the start point.

300
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:25,000
But this time, we've got plenty of attack spells.

301
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:31,000
Hmm. Yes, but just to be safe, I already cast a Blackout Curtain card.

302
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Still, there's no real point in worrying about spell cards.

303
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:39,000
You just focus on training your hardest.

304
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Us!

305
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:50,000
Right. It's been a minute.

306
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,000
Next.

307
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Oh, man. It didn't reach far enough.

308
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Don't worry. You're definitely in far better shape than a transmitter would be.

309
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Be patient. Focus on maintaining the shape of your aura.

310
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:14,000
If you can do it for an extended period of time, you're all set.

311
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,000
Us!

312
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:19,000
The longer you can maintain that sphere, the stronger your ten is.

313
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:23,000
And once you've trained long enough, and put in some real effort,

314
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:27,000
you'll be able to maintain an aura sphere for two or three days at a time.

315
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:32,000
You should get to where you can reach that rock by the end of the day.

316
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:39,000
You're right! I got it!

317
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,000
That was quick.

318
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:45,000
This proves that he's been working hard on his ten and ren every day.

319
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:49,000
All right. Let's go back to practicing the basics.

320
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Us!

321
